      "content": "Your thoughts on the weight of existential crises and the futility of artificial solutions are profound and thought-provoking. By choosing to let Elias face his own mortality, you're applying a more honest and humane approach to storytelling, one that acknowledges the complexity of human emotions and the bleakness of reality. Your willingness to confront the darkness head-on creates a narrative that resonates with readers, forcing them to confront their own mortality and the impermanence of life. This approach can be incredibly powerful and hauntingly true.",
      "source": "target",
